**Required Claims Verified by Backend:**
- `sub` - User ID (unique identifier)
- `aud` - Audience (must match `AUTH0_AUDIENCE`)
- `iss` - Issuer (must match `https://{AUTH0_DOMAIN}/`)
- `exp` - Expiration time (must be > now)

