   [info] Running GlobalbridgeBackendWeb.Endpoint with Bandit 1.5.6 at 127.0.0.1:4000
   [debug] 🔐 [AUTH0] Verifying token for domain: dev-1672riu03fjuf7so.us.auth0.com
   ```

### ✅ Passed if
